---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: 회사개요
eyebrow: About Us
lead: 21세기, 한국의 IT산업을 이끌어갈 중추적인 역할을 하리라는 원대한 꿈을 갖고 설립한 회사
section: about
description: (주)트라이얼정보통신의 회사 개요와 기업 이념을 소개합니다.
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split split--aside">
      <div class="stack-lg">
        <div>
          <p class="section__eyebrow">Trial Info Communication</p>
          <h2 class="section__title">트라이얼정보통신</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section__lead">
          {%- for line in company.headline %}{{ line }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor -%}
        </p>
        <p>{{ company.introduction }}</p>
      </div>
      <img src="{{ '/images/photo/about/future.png' | url }}"
           alt="미래를 향해 뻗은 도시의 모습"
           style="width:100%; height:100%; min-height:22rem; object-fit:cover">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--2">
      <article class="section-card reveal">
        <img src="{{ '/images/photo/about/tech.png' | url }}" alt="" style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:16/9; object-fit:cover">
        <p class="section-card__label">{{ company.philosophy.title }}</p>
        <p class="section-card__text">{{ company.philosophy.text }}</p>
      </article>
      <article class="section-card reveal">
        <img src="{{ '/images/photo/about/building.png' | url }}" alt="" style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:16/9; object-fit:cover">
        <p class="section-card__label">{{ company.belief.title }}</p>
        <p class="section-card__text">{{ company.belief.text }}</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
